   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Baltimore Johnny**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **On And On**: back after 299 archived shows (1981 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Steps**: back after 52 archived shows (371 days) [2]\n- **We Shall All Be Reunited**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-02-21.mk4v.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 151 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests joined the band: Ronnie McCoury played mandolin and Nathaniel Smith played cello. The notes don't say on which songs [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-02-21.mk4v.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk4v (DINa) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [1]. Also: Transfer path: WAV files processed in Sound Studio, then xACT, ending as 24/96 FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Bridgestone Arena Winter 2026 - N1/N2 Uncut Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/bridgestone-arena-winter-2026-n1-n2-uncut-poster-regular/) [3]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Bridgestone Arena Winter 2026 - N2 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/bridgestone-arena-winter-2026-n2-poster-regular/) [4]\n- Poster by Railey Bace: [Billy Strings Nashville Tennessee 2026 Bridgestone Arena Night 2 Poster On February 21 2026 Art By Railey Bace Prints Po](https://blaxteeco.com/product/billy-strings-nashville-tennessee-2026-bridgestone-arena-night-2-poster-on-february-21-2026-art-by-railey-bace-prints-poster-canvas/) [5]",
